---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CompetitorComparison from '../components/landing/CompetitorComparison.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="CompareExcel Features — Excel Compare Columns & Sheet Diff Matrix"
  description="CompareExcel feature matrix: formula inspection, fuzzy row matching, cell annotations, offline diff, and export for excel compare columns, two sheets, two files, dates, and lists."
  keywords="excel compare columns, excel compare two sheets, excel compare two files, excel compare dates, excel compare two lists, excel compare, online excel compare, feature matrix"
  ogImage="/og-image.png"
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-canvas">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mb-16 text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="text-caption text-link">FEATURE MATRIX & ARCHITECTURE</div>
      <h1 class="text-display-lg text-ink">ENGINEERED FOR SPREADSHEET SUPREMACY</h1>
      <p class="font-serif text-lg text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Discover how formula awareness, smart fuzzy row matching, cell annotations, and export tools revolutionize Excel auditing — all with zero server uploads.
      </p>
    </div>

    <CompetitorComparison />

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-xs font-mono">
      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">01. FORMULA INSPECTION</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Standard tools only read calculated display numbers. CompareExcel inspects underlying formulas (`=SUM(A1:A100)` vs `=SUM(A1:A99)`), highlighting subtle calculation errors before they reach production.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">02. FUZZY ROW ALIGNMENT</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          If a row is added or sorted differently, conventional diff tools mark all subsequent rows as deleted/added. Our smart algorithm computes row signatures to keep matching data aligned seamlessly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">03. CELL ANNOTATIONS</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Audit with precision. Click any cell in the diff grid to flag items, leave reviewer notes, and export comprehensive audit summaries for compliance sign-off.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">04. ZERO SERVER UPLOADS</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          100% client-side processing. No files ever leave your browser. Works offline once loaded, with no third-party analytics on spreadsheet contents.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">05. COLUMN SET OPERATIONS</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Compare two lists with set logic: intersection, unique left values, and unique right values. Instant CSV download of matching and non-matching rows.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">06. ID-BASED RECONCILIATION</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Match records by primary key (Account Code, SKU) across unordered rows. Highlights mismatches instantly for financial ledgers and inventory audits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">07. SYNCHRONIZED SIDE-BY-SIDE</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Visual file-to-file diff with aligned spreadsheets and synchronized scrolling. Modified cells in amber, added rows in emerald green, deleted rows in rose red, formula changes in indigo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-title-sm text-ink">08. HTML & CSV EXPORT</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Generate a high-density, printable HTML report for PDF conversion. Download reconciliation and column comparison results as CSV for downstream workflows.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
